              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After these things I saw, and behold, a great multitude, which no man could number, out of every nation and of ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tribes and peoples and tongues, standing before the throne and before the Lamb, arrayed in white robes, and palms in their hands; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
